        "why": "bloodline-23 (Draconic, Player Core 2): \"Sorcerous Gifts ... 2nd: see Draconic Exemplars below; 5th: see Draconic Exemplars below; 8th: see Draconic Exemplars below\" and \"choose the tradition related to the dragon exemplar who influenced your bloodline ... this affects both your bloodline's features and your sorcerous gift spells\". Each exemplar's own 2nd/5th/8th gifts are its page's \"Sorcerous Gifts\" line: draconic-exemplar-41, draconic-exemplar-42, draconic-exemplar-43, draconic-exemplar-44, draconic-exemplar-1, draconic-exemplar-2, draconic-exemplar-3, draconic-exemplar-4, draconic-exemplar-5, draconic-exemplar-6, draconic-exemplar-7, draconic-exemplar-8, draconic-exemplar-9, draconic-exemplar-10, draconic-exemplar-11, draconic-exemplar-12, draconic-exemplar-13, draconic-exemplar-14, draconic-exemplar-15, draconic-exemplar-16, draconic-exemplar-17, draconic-exemplar-18, draconic-exemplar-19, draconic-exemplar-20, draconic-exemplar-21, draconic-exemplar-22, draconic-exemplar-23, draconic-exemplar-24, draconic-exemplar-25, draconic-exemplar-26, draconic-exemplar-27, draconic-exemplar-28, draconic-exemplar-29, draconic-exemplar-30, draconic-exemplar-31, draconic-exemplar-32, draconic-exemplar-33, draconic-exemplar-34, draconic-exemplar-35, draconic-exemplar-36, draconic-exemplar-37, draconic-exemplar-38, draconic-exemplar-39, draconic-exemplar-40 (Draconic Codex pg. 206; Player Core 2 pg. 150 for the four tradition rows). Keyed by our dragonChoice slug and answered by the Dragon exemplar question the builder already asks. The ten legacy dragons in that list (black ... white) have no page of their own and take their tradition's row. Before this row the option's flat grantedSpells listed all four Player Core 2 2nd-rank gifts at once and the app could not tell which was the character's.",
